Test Cases Summary:

This file contains 250 comprehensive test cases organized into the following categories:

CATEGORY 1: FUNCTIONAL TESTS (100 cases)
- Agent Initialization and Startup (TC001-TC012)
- Configuration Management (TC013-TC020)
- Message Processing and Queuing (TC021-TC035)
- Circuit Breaker and Rate Limiting (TC036-TC040)
- Connection and Timeout Management (TC041-TC055)
- Authentication and Authorization (TC056-TC070)
- Caching and Serialization (TC071-TC080)
- Database Operations (TC081-TC090)
- Scheduled Jobs and Events (TC091-TC100)

CATEGORY 2: PERFORMANCE TESTS (20 cases - TC101-TC120)
- Response Time Measurement
- Throughput and Concurrency
- Memory and CPU Usage
- Connection Pool Performance
- Cold/Warm Start Times
- Recovery Times

CATEGORY 3: SECURITY TESTS (30 cases - TC121-TC150)
- Authentication and Authorization bypass
- SQL Injection and XSS prevention
- CSRF and Session protection
- SSL/TLS security
- Password policies and encryption
- Audit logging and access control

CATEGORY 4: INTEGRATION TESTS (30 cases - TC151-TC180)
- Database and message queue integration
- Cache and search engine integration
- External API and webhook integration
- OAuth, SAML, LDAP integration
- Cloud provider and Kubernetes integration
- Monitoring and logging integration

CATEGORY 5: EDGE CASES (40 cases - TC181-TC220)
- Empty and null inputs
- Maximum and minimum values
- Unicode and special characters
- Network and database failures
- Resource exhaustion scenarios
- Clock skew and firewall blocking

CATEGORY 6: ERROR HANDLING (20 cases - TC221-TC240)
- HTTP error codes (4xx and 5xx)
- Connection and SSL failures
- Timeout and retry handling
- Cascade failure prevention

CATEGORY 7: COMPATIBILITY TESTS (10 cases - TC241-TC250)
- Backward and forward compatibility
- API deprecation and schema evolution
- Client SDK and browser compatibility
- OS and protocol version compatibility

Each test case includes:
- Test Case ID
- Category
- Test Scenario
- Test Description
- Preconditions
- Test Steps
- Expected Result
- Priority
- Status

Total: 250 Test Cases